{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p>A train traveled <math alttext=\"173\"><mn>173</mn>\n</math> miles in the first <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> hours of a trip and traveled at an average speed of <math alttext=\"53\"><mn>53</mn>\n</math> miles per hour for the remainder of the trip. Which equation gives the total number of miles, <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>, the train traveled if the trip was <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> hours long and <math alttext=\"x greater than 3\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>?&nbsp;</p>", "keys": ["62e0d40b-df91-4f2a-845e-7859ee6f453a"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "07ff3552-bf63-4af9-a686-4a76ac8ac245", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"y equals 53 x plus 173\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>53</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>173</mn></math></p>"}, {"id": "62e0d40b-df91-4f2a-845e-7859ee6f453a", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"y equals 53 x plus 14\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>53</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>"}, {"id": "0a7366f3-6b58-4380-9243-79ce496d0c70", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"y equals 14 x plus 226\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>226</mn></math></p>"}, {"id": "2c5352ef-74a5-4f7e-ad27-83eb148193af", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"y equals 14 x plus 53\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>53</mn></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p>Choice B is correct. It&rsquo;s given that a train traveled <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"173\"><mn>173</mn></math>&nbsp;miles in the first <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math> hours of a trip. It's also given that the train traveled at an average speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"53\"><mn>53</mn></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"> miles per hour for the remainder of the trip. Since the trip was </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"> hours long, it follows that the remainder of the trip was </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 3\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"> hours.</span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"> Therefore, </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"53 left parenthesis x minus 3 right parenthesis\"><mn>53</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">represents the distance, in miles, the train traveled for the remainder of the trip. Adding </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"173\"><mn>173</mn></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">&nbsp;to </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"53 left parenthesis x minus 3 right parenthesis\"><mn>53</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\"> gives the total number of miles,&nbsp;</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">, the train traveled if the trip was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;hours long and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x greater than 3\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></span><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">. It follows that </span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 173 plus 53 left parenthesis x minus 3 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>173</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>53</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">, which is equivalent to&nbsp;</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 173 plus 53 x minus 159\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>173</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>53</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>159</mn></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">, or&nbsp;</span><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 53 x plus 14\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>53</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></math><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">.</span></p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. This equation gives the total number of miles,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>, the train traveled if the trip was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x plus 3\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, not <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>, hours long.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "9757792c-41ae-4f55-afe7-6d7d77147ac6", "correct_answer": ["B"]}